{title: 082 - Before Jehovah's Awful Throne}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: God the Father}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[D]Before [A7/E]Jehovah's [D]awfulthrone [A]Ye [D]nations, [G]bow [F#m]with [Em]sacred [D]joy;
[D]Know that [A7/C#]the [D]Lord is God a [A7/E]lone; [D]He [F#m]can [G]create, [A7/E]and [G]He [D/A]destroy.

Verse 2:
[D]His sovereign [A/E]power, [D]without [F#m]our [D]aid,
[D]Made [A7/E]us [G]of [D]clay, [A]and [D]formed [G]us [Em]men;
[D]and [A7/C#]when [D]like wandering [G]sheep [D]we strayed,
[D]He [A7/C#]brought [D/F#]us [G]to [D]His [F#m]fold [D]again.

Verse 3:
[D]We'll [A7/E]crowd [G]His [D]gates with thankful songs,
[D]High [A7/E]as [G]the [D]heavens our voices raise;
[D]And [A7/C#]earth, [D]with her ten [A]thousand [D]tongues,
[D]Shall [A7/C#]fill [D/F#]His [G]courts [D]with [F#m]sounding [D/A]praise.

Verse 4:
[D]Wide [A7/E]as [G]the [D]world [A]is [D]His [G]command,
[D]Vast [A7/E]as [G]Eternity His [Em]love;
[D]Firm [A7/C#]as [D/F#]a [G]rock [D]His [F#m]truth [D]shall stand,
[D]When [A7/C#]rolling [G]years [D]shall [F#m]cease [D]to move.
